WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-04 - If You Walked Away (Live in Chicago)
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Live in Chicago (1990)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.223
[Warm Arena Applause & Gentle Piano Intro]

00:00:03.223 --> 00:00:09.128
Thank you. We're gonna slow things down for you for just a minute...

00:00:09.128 --> 00:00:17.616
[Delicate Piano Arpeggios]

00:00:17.616 --> 00:00:22.500
The streetlights make a blurry line

00:00:25.102 --> 00:00:30.067
I'm running through the same old signs

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:37.500
I'm just a face in a passing crowd

00:00:39.045 --> 00:00:45.000
Afraid to speak my thoughts out loud

00:00:47.371 --> 00:00:52.500
