00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:23.532
If you walked away, the sky would lose its blue

00:01:23.612 --> 00:01:30.274
I wouldn't know what to do, I'd be lost in the gray

00:01:30.614 --> 00:01:39.117
If you walked away, my world would fall apart

00:01:41.058 --> 00:01:49.000
You're the owner of my neon heart

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:57.572
[Piano & Rhythm Section Interlude]

00:01:57.572 --> 00:02:02.500
They build these walls so high and steep

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:09.500
With promises they never keep

00:02:12.688 --> 00:02:17.000
But we have a fortress, strong and true

00:02:18.803 --> 00:02:25.000
I'm safe as long as I have you

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:32.000
If you walked away, the sky would lose its blue

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:39.500
I wouldn't know what to do, I'd be lost in the gray

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:48.451
If you walked away, my world would fall apart

00:02:51.153 --> 00:03:00.020
You're the owner of my neon heart

00:03:02.182 --> 00:03:09.500
I'm holding on, I'm holding tight

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:19.000
Don't let me go into the night...

00:03:19.603 --> 00:03:27.288
If you walked away, the sky would lose its blue

00:03:27.369 --> 00:03:33.893
I wouldn't know what to do, I'd be lost in the gray

00:03:34.353 --> 00:03:43.399
If you walked away, my world would fall apart

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:55.000
You're the owner of my heart

00:04:00.948 --> 00:04:04.500
Don't walk away...

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:08.960
Thank you so much.
